[{"title":"为王阳史司丞赋得玉女潭诗七首 其五 虬鼍峡","author":"沈鍊","text":"磐磐象石分，灵物来稽首。\n陆离潜精英，蜿蜒成并偶。\n云气应时生，流泉喷其口。\n连卷若九回，映带双悬浏。\n日月并光曜，雷霆鞭不走。\n元气结于斯，天地固同朽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23150,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为王阳史司丞赋得玉女潭诗七首 其六 玉树湍","author":"沈鍊","text":"琪树生涧壑，流湍布涯涘。\n芳华绕云霓，朱叶亦繁止。\n百尺振柯条，千龄拓元始。\n先民咏风诗，彤管辉太史。\n秀色餐神仙，拍袂洪厓子。\n飞盖相追随，清觞复伊迩。\n谢彼桃李颜，抱琴来就此。\n翱翔以永年，振衣崇燕喜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23151,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为王阳史司丞赋得玉女潭诗七首 其七 玉阳洞","author":"沈鍊","text":"伊郁北山阿，阶庭气色多。\n画栏云物近，芳榭月明过。\n捣药依岩洞，题书荫薜萝。\n不须寻石室，缑岭听笙歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23152,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简友人病起","author":"沈鍊","text":"忆昨藤床抱病幽，短篱萧瑟不胜愁。\n复怜云树留青眼，不恨江山对白头。\n新制道衣仍侣伴，旧盟耶水有孤舟。\n更增药饵开藜杖，春日春风恣远游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23153,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送鲍元英太学北上二首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"平生鲍子最相知，无奈河梁送别时。\n临水慇勤说不尽，明朝斗酒共相持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23154,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送鲍元英太学北上二首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"北去京华路几千，怜君独上木兰船。\n逢人早寄平安信，莫使离心对月悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23155,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画赠王太医","author":"沈鍊","text":"飞花作埒石床安，身在烟霞梦亦閒。\n多少白头车马客，不如高卧驻朱颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23156,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠葛仪封堤成二首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"为政一年驯鸟雀，筑堤千里障鱼龙。\n他年传说仪封令，只有淮阳葛长公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23157,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠葛仪封堤成二首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"郑国渠成千里完，葛公堤就万人欢。\n鱼惊浅浪穿花度，鸟羡微波隔叶看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23158,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送赵少府","author":"沈鍊","text":"莫以才䧺骑从偏，驱驰随地策风烟。\n丈夫自要报明主，何用黄金铸马鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23159,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴中春兴","author":"沈鍊","text":"江云漠漠低沙树，山雨霏霏集苑楼。\n入夜图书看烛坐，逢春尊俎傍花愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23160,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孙明府自命有春山之篇属余次韵","author":"沈鍊","text":"南国名山福地真，烟花长发四时春。\n东隅采日方鸣凤，温谷条风为袭人。\n兰蕙平林还结佩，云霞满地即成茵。\n会怜仙客披襟处，和气氤氲拂紫宸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23161,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送施敬之还武昌","author":"沈鍊","text":"扁舟初发若耶溪，归梦先能到浙西。\n行李惟馀一吟卷，经过山水尽留题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23162,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭君怨","author":"沈鍊","text":"琵琶清影月中回，弹尽宫商恨不开。\n汉苑笙歌今夜别，番城车马几时来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23163,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜怀张平山","author":"沈鍊","text":"仲春正值桃花节，夜忆仙郎谷口居。\n耿耿明河瞻气色，悠悠旅雁隔音书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23164,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游五泄山五首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"流泉五道吐奇芬，秀色遥怜少室云。\n名境未能逢一赏，何须夜夜隐星文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23165,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游五泄山五首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"七十二峰云外重，削成片片似芙蓉。\n山灵自爱多标格，容与青山碧汉中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23166,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游五泄山五首 其三","author":"沈鍊","text":"岩明岛秀并回芳，何羡天台有石梁。\n神气自多怀蕴结，白云悠处发辉光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23167,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游五泄山五首 其四","author":"沈鍊","text":"岩壑盘旋万仞馀，金楼玉户并仙居。\n不教俗士回尘驾，祇借高人著道书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23168,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游五泄山五首 其五","author":"沈鍊","text":"珍木千章与世殊，瑶花一半近精庐。\n方今金马多才隽，好向名山结隐居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23169,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"济北甄文学有䧺才自题名号数十为书问余余定以一鹤归之因作一鹤吟二首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"山河百道拥亭台，独对仙禽夜举杯。\n解说繁音崇缥缈，不如清影共徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23170,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"济北甄文学有䧺才自题名号数十为书问余余定以一鹤归之因作一鹤吟二首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"调鹤鸣琴意出群，此身长自伴孤云。\n若非骑马咸阳道，那遣华亭唳不闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23171,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题李进士扇图","author":"沈鍊","text":"千卷自于花下发，一尊时向竹边开。\n门前车马如流水，别有高人策杖来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23172,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝民歌","author":"沈鍊","text":"尔我心高气岸浮，自誇伎俩舌如流。\n天公早已安排定，用尽机关不到头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23173,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子仁子渐兄弟载酒远来愧以疏庸相废遂用怃然祗今东还复有日月之别又以旅泊无将以诗赠焉 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"杨郎鼓棹出江城，江日江波紫雾明。\n细雨欲沾行处湿，长风应解别离情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23174,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子仁子渐兄弟载酒远来愧以疏庸相废遂用怃然祗今东还复有日月之别又以旅泊无将以诗赠焉 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"孤舟晓向三吴发，白帽宵从五泄分。\n饱浴江山俱是学，坐摛云雾总成文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23175,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子仁子渐兄弟载酒远来愧以疏庸相废遂用怃然祗今东还复有日月之别又以旅泊无将以诗赠焉 其三","author":"沈鍊","text":"江鸥沙鹭久无疑，可是谈经愧尔师。\n秖说江云可相赠，白头青眼对前期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23176,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子仁子渐兄弟载酒远来愧以疏庸相废遂用怃然祗今东还复有日月之别又以旅泊无将以诗赠焉 其四","author":"沈鍊","text":"青楼细雨玉箫生，闻道诸郎下楚城。\n我有忧心凭慰藉，短蓑何日更江亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23177,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子仁子渐兄弟载酒远来愧以疏庸相废遂用怃然祗今东还复有日月之别又以旅泊无将以诗赠焉 其五","author":"沈鍊","text":"暨阳山水总流传，越女吴姬濯锦边。\n便从五泄攀奇胜，须向杨家泊酒船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23178,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"班婕妤","author":"沈鍊","text":"莫以容颜丽，偏忘明主恩。\n当年不召幸，辛苦在长门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23179,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠祝古峰新第","author":"沈鍊","text":"城作屏风水作帘，更多云雾结为檐。\n君家第宅佳如此，谁遣停杯日未淹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23180,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送赵子敷母","author":"沈鍊","text":"芳筵罗绮夜初成，山阁逶迤弦管清。\n既是白头同日老，犹悬高月照人明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23181,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘子臣","author":"沈鍊","text":"年少披裘隐中野，月光正射茅檐下。\n照见怀中五色毫，能图百战蒲捎马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23182,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送门人郑子英还浦阳","author":"沈鍊","text":"兰舟六月荡南征，道上炎风苦未平。\n我有离琴单凤轸，为君弹出玉壶冰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23183,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿浦阳戴氏九灵山房","author":"沈鍊","text":"青楼伊郁白云隈，曲巘重峦四面开。\n水石自多尘外景，烟霞犹向梦中来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23184,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游洞壑山庄","author":"沈鍊","text":"几处山川近世中，向来车马不曾通。\n今宵揽辔烟霞里，何异神仙驭玉龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23185,"sh